; Static class methods: only class methods can be static, not virtual ones;
; without Self, a static method cannot use instance members or class
; methods that need Self.
; RUN: not %pcc --mode=objfpc -ferror-limit=0 -c %S/Inputs/static/errors.pas -o %t.o 2>&1 | FileCheck %s
; CHECK: errors.pas:6:15: error: only class methods can be 'static'
; CHECK: errors.pas:7:21: error: 'static' cannot be used with 'virtual'
; CHECK: errors.pas:12:3: error: instance member 'F' cannot be used in a static class method
; CHECK: errors.pas:13:3: error: class method 'D' cannot be used in a static class method
; CHECK: errors.pas:14:11: error: use of undeclared identifier 'Self'
; CHECK-NOT: error:
